---
title: Thai Iced Tea
image: https://www.simplysuwanee.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/authentic-thai-tea-cha-yen-14-360x360.jpg
time required: 30 minutes
servings: 1
---

Add @thai tea mix{4%tbsp} to kettle and fully submerge with @boiling water{}. Steep for ~{2-4%minutes}.

Strain out the tea into a glass. Mix in @sugar{3%tsp} and @sweetened condensed milk{2%tsp} while the tea is still warm.

Put glass in fridge until ready to serve. Add @ice{} when serving.

> We prefer the Pantai thai tea mix.